            0.401
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Figure it out",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.41,
            0.883,
            0.528
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q. Evaluate these expressions by thinking of them as the resulting movement of combining button presses:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " a. (+ 1) + (+ 4) = b. (+ 4) + (+ 1) = c. (+ 4) + (– 3) + (– 2) = d. (– 1) + (+ 2) + (– 3) = Ans. a. (+5) b. (+5) c. (-1) d. (-2)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.564,
            0.464,
            0.581
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q. Write the inverses of these numbers:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.617,
            0.347,
            0.773
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. Inverse of +4 = -4 Inverse of -4 = +4 Inverse of -3 = +3 Inverse of 0 = 0 Inverse of +2 = (-2) Inverse of -1 = +1"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
